*Nigeria advanced to play Denmark (runner-up of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group C|Group C]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Nigeria vs Denmark|round of 16]].
*Paraguay advanced to play France (winner of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group C|Group C]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#France vs Paraguay|round of 16]].

